'''Amulets''' are a [[item class|class of items]] that provide a variety of different bonuses when [[Equipment|equipped]]. They are categorised as [[jewellery]].

Like most jewellery items, amulets do not come with gem [[socket]]s. The two exceptions are {{il|Unset Amulet}} and {{il|Black Maw Talisman}}, which gain sockets from their [[modifier]]s.

